1
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:04,504
My name is Balaram Muduli.

2
00:00:05,255 --> 00:00:07,340
The name of my village is Sansagor.

3
00:00:08,234 --> 00:00:11,386
I belong to the Parenga tribe.

4
00:00:12,038 --> 00:00:15,807
My language is called the Gorum language.

5
00:00:16,015 --> 00:00:21,229
In our Gorum language there is no language teacher.

6
00:00:21,795 --> 00:00:25,984
For other Adivasi languages they have teachers—

7
00:00:26,317 --> 00:00:27,402
They have Juang [teachers]...

8
00:00:27,402 --> 00:00:28,987
They have Santali teachers...

9
00:00:29,696 --> 00:00:31,948
They have Kui teachers...

10
00:00:32,532 --> 00:00:34,701
Hmm...they have Poroja teacher too...

11
00:00:35,201 --> 00:00:36,745
..they have Gadaba (Gutob) teacher too...

12
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:38,913
..they have Bonda teacher too...

13
00:00:39,581 --> 00:00:41,124
..they have Didayi teacher too...

14
00:00:41,207 --> 00:00:42,542
..they have Koya teacher too...

15
00:00:43,251 --> 00:00:53,636
But...in Parenga-Gorum...we still don't have teachers.

16
00:00:54,825 --> 00:01:02,896
If we'll have teachers,...in Parenga-Gorum...Gorum-Parenga language...

17
00:01:03,021 --> 00:01:07,108
Hmm...if we have teachers, it will be good for us.

18
00:01:07,734 --> 00:01:10,862
Our children can also learn Gorum language like other students

19
00:01:11,738 --> 00:01:14,365
Also, they will grow our tribal language.
